--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ABOUT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  A monumental brutalist-gothic cathedral flooded with mirror-still black
  water, pierced by volumetric stained-glass light shafts, a kinetic brass
  pipe organ, and a polar-folded Rose Window.

  Six acts synchronized to a 48 kHz GPU-synthesized polyphonic pipe-organ,
  FM bell choir, plucked dulcimer, and cathedral percussion score with a
  4-line Householder FDN reverb.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  REQUIREMENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Microsoft Edge or Google Chrome on Windows (double-click intro.html)
  * WebGL2 with EXT_color_buffer_float
  * Click the title screen to enter fullscreen and begin playback

